  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">10-Gigabit-capable passive optical networks (XG-PON): Physical media dependent (PMD) layer specification</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">10-Gigabit-capable passive optical networks (XG-PON): Physical media dependent (PMD) layer specification</title>
